---
import { LINKS } from "../../constants/links";
---

<section id="como-funciona-mes" class="pt-10 pb-14 md:py-20 bg-white scroll-mt-20">
  <div class="max-w-[1120px] mx-auto px-5">
    <div class="lp-reveal max-w-[640px] mx-auto text-center mb-9 md:mb-12">
      <h2
        class="text-[clamp(1.7rem,4.2vw,2.5rem)] font-extrabold text-[#1a3a5c] tracking-tight leading-tight mb-3"
      >
        Como fica o seu mês com o Van360
      </h2>
      <p class="text-[1.05rem] sm:text-[1.12rem] text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
        Menos papel, menos mensagem e você sabendo exatamente como está o dinheiro da van.
      </p>
    </div>

    <ol class="grid lg:grid-cols-3 gap-5 lg:gap-6 max-w-[560px] lg:max-w-[1000px] mx-auto">
      <!-- 1 -->
      <li class="lp-reveal rounded-3xl bg-[#f6f8fb] border border-slate-200/80 p-5 sm:p-6 flex flex-col">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
          <span class="w-9 h-9 rounded-full bg-[#1a3a5c] text-white font-extrabold flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">1</span>
          <h3 class="text-[1.15rem] font-extrabold text-[#1a3a5c] leading-tight">
            O pai cadastra o filho e assina o contrato
          </h3>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-auto rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200 p-3 shadow-sm space-y-2" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between rounded-xl bg-slate-50 px-3 py-2.5">
            <span class="text-[0.92rem] font-semibold text-slate-800">Ficha do aluno</span>
            <span class="text-[0.75rem] font-black text-emerald-700 bg-emerald-50 border border-emerald-200 rounded-full px-2 py-0.5">PREENCHIDA</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between rounded-xl bg-slate-50 px-3 py-2.5">
            <span class="text-[0.92rem] font-semibold text-slate-800">Contrato</span>
            <span class="text-[0.75rem] font-black text-emerald-700 bg-emerald-50 border border-emerald-200 rounded-full px-2 py-0.5">ASSINADO</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="mt-4 text-[0.98rem] text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">
          Você manda um link no WhatsApp. O pai preenche e assina pelo celular, sem imprimir nada.
        </p>
      </li>

      <!-- 2 -->
      <li class="lp-reveal rounded-3xl bg-[#f6f8fb] border border-slate-200/80 p-5 sm:p-6 flex flex-col">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
          <span class="w-9 h-9 rounded-full bg-[#1a3a5c] text-white font-extrabold flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">2</span>
          <h3 class="text-[1.15rem] font-extrabold text-[#1a3a5c] leading-tight">
            O lembrete do Pix chega no WhatsApp do pai
          </h3>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-auto rounded-2xl bg-[#e7ffdb] border border-emerald-100 p-3.5 shadow-sm" aria-hidden="true">
          <p class="text-[0.93rem] leading-snug text-slate-800">
            Oi! A mensalidade do <strong>Miguel</strong> vence hoje: <strong>R$ 280,00</strong>.
          </p>
          <div class="mt-2 rounded-lg bg-white text-center text-[0.88rem] font-bold text-[#00a884] py-1.5 border border-emerald-100">
            Copiar código Pix
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="mt-4 text-[0.98rem] text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">
          No dia do vencimento e, se atrasar, de novo. Você não precisa cobrar ninguém.
        </p>
      </li>

      <!-- 3 -->
      <li class="lp-reveal rounded-3xl bg-[#f6f8fb] border border-slate-200/80 p-5 sm:p-6 flex flex-col">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
          <span class="w-9 h-9 rounded-full bg-[#1a3a5c] text-white font-extrabold flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">3</span>
          <h3 class="text-[1.15rem] font-extrabold text-[#1a3a5c] leading-tight">
            Você vê quem pagou e manda o recibo
          </h3>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-auto rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200 p-3 shadow-sm space-y-2" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between rounded-xl bg-slate-50 px-3 py-2">
            <span class="text-[0.92rem] font-semibold text-slate-800">Miguel</span>
            <span class="text-[0.75rem] font-black text-emerald-700 bg-emerald-50 border border-emerald-200 rounded-full px-2 py-0.5">PAGO</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between rounded-xl bg-slate-50 px-3 py-2">
            <span class="text-[0.92rem] font-semibold text-slate-800">Sofia</span>
            <span class="text-[0.75rem] font-black text-emerald-700 bg-emerald-50 border border-emerald-200 rounded-full px-2 py-0.5">PAGO</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between rounded-xl bg-slate-50 px-3 py-2">
            <span class="text-[0.92rem] font-semibold text-slate-800">Lucas</span>
            <span class="text-[0.75rem] font-black text-red-700 bg-red-50 border border-red-200 rounded-full px-2 py-0.5">EM ATRASO</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="mt-4 text-[0.98rem] text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">
          O recibo com o seu logo vai pro pai em 1 toque. No fim do mês você sabe quanto entrou e quanto sobrou.
        </p>
      </li>
    </ol>

    <div class="lp-reveal text-center mt-10">
      <a
        href={LINKS.APP_REGISTER_URL}
        class="inline-flex items-center justify-center bg-[#f59e0b] hover:bg-[#d97706] text-[#1a1a1a] font-black text-[1.05rem] px-8 py-4 rounded-xl shadow-md hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-all min-h-[54px]"
      >
        Testar 15 dias grátis →
      </a>
      <p class="text-[0.9rem] text-slate-600 mt-2.5 font-medium">
        Tudo isso já funciona no período grátis.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
